    "text": "To determine how many more pages Cristobal read compared to Beatrix, we need to follow these steps:\n\n1. Identify the number of pages Beatrix read.\n2. Calculate the number of pages Cristobal read based on the information given.\n3. Find the difference between the number of pages Cristobal read and the number of pages Beatrix read.\n\nStep 1: Identify the number of pages Beatrix read.\nBeatrix read 704 pages.\n\nStep 2: Calculate the number of pages Cristobal read.\nCristobal read 15 more than three times the pages that Beatrix read. First, we need to find three times the number of pages Beatrix read:\n\\[ 3 \\times 704 = 2112 \\]\nNext, we add 15 to this amount to find the number of pages Cristobal read:\n\\[ 2112 + 15 = 2127 \\]\nSo, Cristobal read 2127 pages.\n\nStep 3: Find the difference between the number of pages Cristobal read and the number of pages Beatrix read.\n\\[ 2127 - 704 = 1423 \\]\nTherefore, Cristobal read \\(\\boxed{1423}\\) more pages than Beatrix.",
